{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14405","headline":"喜雨 · 戴叔伦","name":"喜雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲居倦时燠，开轩俯平林。\n雷声殷遥空，云气布层阴。\n川上风雨来，洒然涤烦襟。\n田家共欢笑，沟浍亦已深。\n团团聚邻曲，斗酒相与斟。\n樵歌野田中，渔钓沧江浔。\n苍天暨有念，悠悠终我心。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"戴叔伦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14405.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14405","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}